      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 440,
        "height": 768,
        "content": "## Enterprise Shopify Product to WordPress SEO Blog Engine\n\nAutomate long-form SEO blog creation from your Shopify products directly to WordPress with Notion logging and Slack alerts.\n\n### HOW IT WORKS\n1. **Fetch Products**: Pulls active products from Shopify on a weekly schedule.\n2. **Format Data**: Extracts key properties (Title, Price, Vendor, Image) via Code node.\n3. **AI Keyword & Outline**: Uses OpenAI to research target SEO keywords and a 5-section outline.\n4. **AI Long-Form Writer**: Generates a 1500+ word HTML SEO blog post with product CTAs.\n5. **Publish & Log**: Auto-drafts the post to WordPress, logs to Notion, and alerts Slack.\n6. **Error Handling**: Sends real-time dev alerts on Slack if any API execution fails.\n\n### HOW TO SET UP\n- **Shopify**: Add Access Token & Shop Subdomain in credentials.\n- **OpenAI**: Add API Key for GPT-4o-mini & GPT-4o models.\n- **WordPress**: Connect WP REST API (Username & Application Password).\n- **Notion**: Select your 'Blog Logs' Database.\n- **Slack**: Select destination channels for announcements & error alerts."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
